T[15723]={"^Anetheron restores health equal to 100%% of all damage he inflicts, increased by 2%% for each percentage of his missing health%.\n\nOn Mythic and Ascended difficulty (.-)%% of all healing generated by Vampiric Aura is also converted into Shadow damage and inflicted to Anetheron's current target%. Damage inflicted by Vampiric Aura doesn't generate healing%.%s*$","Anetheron recuperada vida igual a 100% de todo o dano que causa, aumentado em 2% para cada percentual de vida perdida.\n\nEm dificuldade Mítico e Ascensão, {{1}}% de toda a cura gerada por Aura Vampírica é transformado em dano de Sombra e causado a Anetheron's alvo atual. O dano causado por Aura Vampírica não gera cura."}
